T1  - Enhanced Radiation Hardness of InAs/GaAs Quantum Dot Lasers for Space Communication
AU  - Li, Manyang
AU  - Duan, Jianan
AU  - Jin, Zhiyong
AU  - Pan, Shujie
AU  - Zhan, Wenkang
AU  - Chen, Jinpeng
AU  - Yu, Jinling
